## 9. SECURITY CONFIGURATION

Row Level Security (RLS) is enabled on the main tables (`jnl` and `chart_of_accounts`). Read-only policies allow both `anon` and `authenticated` roles to select data. Views do not have RLS directly; instead, `security_invoker = true` is set on each view so that the underlying table policies are enforced when the view is queried. The `service_role` key is never used in the frontend or public code.

